WEBVTT

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.870
Are all the men ready?

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:42.540
Yes, everything is on standby.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.040
My father?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.130
He's resting inside the tent.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.340
I see.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:51.380
Shunan-sama.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.630
What is it?

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:53.920
There's something which concerns me.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.260
Speak.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:59.760
An extra large carriage was drawn to the Queen's hands, cloaked in darkness.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:08.810
There's a rumor that a beast-lord came and saved the Queen when Harumiya-sama was assaulted by Touda.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:13.150
The men are afraid that a miracle might actually occur.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:20.570
Ridiculous.  That's a tale fabricated by the Queen to unnerve us.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:24.330
Beast-lords and Touda never befriend humans.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:30.080
How could anyone possibly manage to gain full control over a beast when they can barely bind them by chains and mute whistles?

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:36.720
When the blue flag fails to raise, there will be nothing to protect them.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:41.640
Right now, we await her answer.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:50.560
By the time this night passes, I must make my decision.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.690
Seimiya-sama.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.780
Damiya-sama.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.030
My sincere apologies.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.780
I failed to finish him.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.040
<i>You're a useless man at critical moments.</i>

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.380
<i>I've lost faith in you.  Leave to wherever you wish.</i>

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.590
But I've inflicted a wound on him.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.760
I'll find him and when I do...

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.890
There's no need to rush.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.770
He'll come here.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.690
That man...

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:36.190
He seems to have developed a liking for that Arryo woman.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.040
The little girl doesn't look so well.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.670
She can't help it.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:55.130
I wish we could do something.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.760
We have a problem, little girl!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.840
Hey, get a grip!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.430
Wake up!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:12.330
Dawn at Ryoza

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.110
I can't use a bow and arrow in this wind.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:30.500
Seems you still have an edge, Ial the Speed Runner.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.250
Kyle.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.210
I told you to run.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.420
The guard was tight.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:44.680
Besides, Damiya and the Queen are surrounded by those masked guys, instead of Sezans.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:49.310
Even for you, going in alone would be suicidal.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:52.600
But don't worry.  I'll follow you in.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.780
The help of an injured man is more of a hindrance.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.740
Well would you look who's talking?

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.950
I'm grateful to you.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.620
But beyond this point, I want to put an end to this myself.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.000
What are you-

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:23.340
I became a Sezan by leaving my family behind because I wanted to ensure they were cared for.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.860
To me, Harumiya-sama was...

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:56.920
We can't allow a man who would kill his own aunt govern this country.

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:03.340
In honor of the girl who would tell someone like me to seize my own happiness, too.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:09.510
I see.  Then I suppose you're not planning on going in there to die.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.220
In that case, I guess the hindrance will keep back.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.600
Besides, looks like you've found a new light.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.190
"Light?"

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.580
Ial, eh?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:46.670
<i>So Erin was being betrayed by her fellow teacher.</i>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.390
You know, don't you?

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.810
Why are you saving me?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:06.190
I cannot ignore the wounded.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.400
I'm sorry.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.200
Show me your hand.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:21.630
Don't worry.  These wounds are not from fighting with him.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:26.210
Why did you come here?

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.090
Tahya.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:37.980
What's that?

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:39.730
What is it?

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.690
That's-!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.300
Ngan.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.700
What's the meaning of this, Ngan?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:35.820
Those Touda are what I gave you to protect the castle.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:41.120
I can't stand idle in the time of our country's greatest need.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.250
This is no war.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.630
Of course not.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:57.180
You are trying to subjugate the Queen by using an army of Touda granted to the Grand Duke.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.260
This is treason.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.020
I'm...

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.140
I'm not trying to subjugate Seimiya-sama.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:08.150
That's exactly what I want to see with my own eyes.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.480
Ngan!

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.570
Do as you like!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.740
Father!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:22.960
Ngan, observe with your very own eyes the moment your brother changes this world.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:29.170
See him accomplish what even Yaman Hasal could not.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.010
Only the gods know fate.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.430
Grand Duke!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.690
Father!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.230
Shunan.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.480
To these old eyes...

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.450
Present unto them the moment of change.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.950
Show me the light of a new era.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.700
Will you?

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.580
Rest assured.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:14.380
When the sun rises from on that horizon, everything will change.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.120
Are you frightened?

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:47.000
You shouldn't move yet, Kiriku-sensei.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:53.000
If it...

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:58.380
If it's before the sun rises, you could escape.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:03.970
Would you... want to come with me?

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.530
I can't.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:24.540
I don't know if light or darkness waits beyond this point.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:33.590
Even so, I will travel the path of survival with Lilan until it no longer exists.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.800
"Lilan."

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.130
That means "light," right?

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:47.220
I'll hope that light will wash over you.

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:03.620
Kiriku-sensei.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:13.250
Kiriku-sensei!

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:14.840
Please live on.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.050
Please continue to live.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.800
<i>Onii-sama...  Please live on!</i>

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:27.470
<i>Please... find happiness!</i>

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.730
You use the same words as Tahya did.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.360
Tahya?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.490
My younger sister.

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.950
If she were alive, she'd be about your age.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.490
Thank you, Erin.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:04.050
I hope you will live on... and find happiness.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.050
The dawn will come soon!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.510
Do we want to settle this once and for all?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.520
What is this about?

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.900
Were you planning to die?

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:32.740
You're a really annoying man.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.080
Damiya-sama was more than right.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.790
Two useless pawns appeared at the same time.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:16:03.650
<i>A scourge scorches across my hazy eyes. </i>

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:17.620
<i>Uttering a prayer is now only a hope, lost long ago. </i>

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:31.800
<i>Getting completely soaked, I see a pool of water to the side. </i>

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:45.810
<i>The surface is so placid, it gives a reflection of the event. </i>

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.860
<i>Wrongness is the sin of not noticing.
Hurry and go to where she is!</i>

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:55.570
<i>Wrongness is the sin of not noticing. </i>

00:16:55.570 --> 00:17:02.160
<i>Even as the last moment creeps close, </i>

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:12.050
<i>your soul's voice won't be captured, just like that cloud. </i>

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:18.050
<i>Is this only a momentary thing? </i>

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:25.190
<i>Is this only an illusion? </i>

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:31.320
<i>What stretches on from here is a path for beasts. </i>

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.700
Why... didn't you leave?
<i>What stretches on from here is a path for beasts. </i>

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:35.200
<i>Gaze up to the skies.
Why... didn't you leave?</i>

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.700
<i>Gaze up to the skies. </i>

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.660
I won't let you die.
<i>Gaze up to the skies. </i>

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.780
<i>Gaze up to the skies. </i>

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.500
Yours is a life I can save.
<i>Gaze up to the skies. </i>

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:43.410
<i>Gaze up to the skies. </i>

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.880
I can manage to stop the bleeding myself.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:52.760
If you're going to approach Damiya-sama, use this.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:57.220
Go.  Go and...

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.010
Take care of Erin.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.980
Hey, hey.  It's not time yet.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.440
Keep it down.

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:13.530
Lilan.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.990
Calm down.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:21.580
All the Touda are still far away.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:25.040
Listen... to my heart.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.730
Erin-sensei.

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:19.590
The dawn is near.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.480
I see the light, too.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:25.830
It's beautiful, Tahya.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:49.100
There's nothing to cry about, Seimiya.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:53.190
There's no need to cry, no matter how many Touda may gather.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.600
Touda?

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:06.410
It's not that.  I didn't know.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:13.040
I didn't know how vast and beautiful the world is.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:25.720
In ancient times, the ancestor of the Queen descended from Ephon Noha to Tahai Aze.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:30.600
When the Founding Queen walked through the field littered with corpses,

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.810
above Her flew beast-lords,

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:42.190
and in the water were Touda bowing their heads to Her, giving Her way.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:51.410
People met the Founding Queen, Je, who had golden hair and golden eyes.

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:56.210
It was the holy God Herself.

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:19.730
Lilan.  The night's ending.

00:24:02.020 --> 00:24:07.870
Erin, you said you didn't wish to use
beast-lords as weapons of war.

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:14.600
The sun has risen above Tahai Aze, so the army of Touda begins to march toward the Queen.

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:21.240
The only thing I can do now is to watch
and fight to the end for you.

00:24:21.700 --> 00:24:25.090
Kemono no Souja Erin.  The Battle.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:26:00.070
The Battle
